. Letting it happen is still me in the bed at 3 in the morning with the clock going","Pressure, I guess. It's not a big deal, it's just the number getting smaller and me not being able to do anything about it","My chest gets tight sometimes."]},"conversation":{"type":"心理健康维护","topic":"长期入睡困难和夜间早醒对工作生活的影响，以及由此产生的焦虑和应对方式"}},"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b054c5fbeecf50d384813b0","chatId":"c79c88d028624820a5f500ed1cb0d326","sessionId":null,"userId":130839,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That 3 a.m. wake-up sounds relentless, and lying there wide awake makes the night feel even longer. When you're awake in those hours, what's going through your mind?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That 3 a.m. wake-up sounds relentless, and lying there wide awake makes the night feel even longer. When you're awake in those hours, what's going through your mind?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2999,"promptTokens":361,"completionTokens":76,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 16:35:43"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":5,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"e9b4d4ad3550427eb425bae35e5712c3","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":1.7952655502749735E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b054c5fbeecf50d384813af","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795509343242,"createTime":"2026-11-24 16:35:43","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b054c5fbeecf50d384813af","chatId":"c79c88d028624820a5f500ed1cb0d326","sessionId":null,"userId":130839,"orgId":3721,"